              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolo suku umlomo wakho uyovuleka kuye okhululiwe, futhi uyokhuluma, ungabe usaba yisimungulu; futhi uyakuba yisibonakaliso kubo; bazakwazi ukuthi nginguJehova.",
          "type": "text",
